{"type":"text","timestamp":1794352199945,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7b9b8d3001qDKFfGw5Z7s81t","messageID":"msg_1c7b99127001xfnvcU00EXJnxe","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"text","text":"<think>npm registry is accessible (via cache). tailwindcss 4.3.5 and @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5 available.\n\nPython: flask not installed locally. Let me check if pip install works (network access to PyPI?). The sandbox \"can install packages from the public package registries (through a read-only cache)\". Let me try installing flask into a venv for local testing.\n\nLet me do that in background while I writecode.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794352199891,"end":1794352199931}}}
