{"type":"text","timestamp":1794352451118,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7bd8e19001zlC6Ed7k7CiEzM","messageID":"msg_1c7bd6d46001XfgSTcJ8Y2hYvs","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"text","text":"<think>Now MonthView and TimeGrid.\n\nMonthView props:\n```tsx\ninterface MonthViewProps {\n  days: Date[];\n  eventsByDay: Map<string, CalendarEvent[]>;\n  onSelectEvent: (event: CalendarEvent) => void;\n  onSelectDay: (day: Date) => void;\n  canCreate: boolean;\n}\n```\n\nEach cell shows up to 3 events; \"+N more\" switches to the day view (handled by the parent via onMore).\n\nLet me add an `onShowDay` prop for \"+N more\" → parent sets view to 'day' and anchor to that day.\n\nAlso clicking a day number → onSelectDay(day) → opens the create form prefilled (if signed in) or just navigates to the day view. I'll make the parent handle: if signed in → open create form with that date; else → switch to day view. Hmm, clicking an empty cell should probably navigate to the day view. I'll make: clicking a day cell (not an event) switches to the day view for that day. And double... no. Keep it: clicking the day number switches to the day view. For signed-in users, a \"+\" button in the cell opens the create form.\n\nLet me include a small \"+\" button in each cell for signed-in users (appears on hover).\n\nTimeGrid props:\n```tsx\ninterface TimeGridProps {\n  days: Date[];\n  eventsByDay: Map<string, CalendarEvent[]>;\n  onSelectEvent: (event: CalendarEvent) => void;\n  onCreateAt: (day: Date, minutes: number) => void;\n  canCreate: boolean;\n}\n```\n\nLayout: a grid with a left gutter (hour labels) and day columns.\n\nI'll implement with a horizontal scroll container for smaller screens: min-w-[640px].\n\nStructure:\n```tsx\n<div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n  <div className=\"min-w-[720px]\">\n    {/* header */}\n    <div className=\"grid\" style={{gridTemplateColumns: `4rem repeat(${days.length}, minmax(0,1fr))`}}>\n      <div />  // corner\n      {days.map(day => <div className=\"...\">{weekday} {date}</div>)}\n    </div>\n    {/* body */}\n    <div className=\"grid\" style={{gridTemplateColumns: `4rem repeat(${days.length}, minmax(0,1fr))`}}>\n      <div className=\"relative\" style={{height: HOUR_HEIGHT*24}}>\n        {hours.map(h => <div className=\"absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-xs text-slate-400\" style={{top: h*HOUR_HEIGHT}}>{pad(h)}:00</div>)}\n      </div>\n      {days.map(day => (\n        <div className=\"relative border-l border-slate-200\" style={{height: HOUR_HEIGHT*24}} onClick={...}>\n          {hours.map(h => <div key={h} className=\"absolute inset-x-0 border-t border-slate-100\" style={{top: h*HOUR_HEIGHT}} />)}\n          {events.map(...)}\n        </div>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\nEvent block positioning with lanes.\n\nLet me write the lane layout helper inside TimeGrid.tsx.\n\nFor the \"now\" indicator: if the day is today, draw a red line at the current UTC time. I'll include it — nice touch.\n\nLet me write thefiles.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794352451097,"end":1794352451113}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794352451148,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c7bd7f82744392dcaa2e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { dateKey, formatTime, isSameDay, todayUtc } from \"../lib/dates\";\nimport type { CalendarEvent } from \"../types\";\n\nconst WEEKDAYS = [\"Mon\", \"Tue\", \"Wed\", \"Thu\", \"Fri\", \"Sat\", \"Sun\"];\nconst MAX_VISIBLE = 3;\n\ninterface MonthViewProps {\n  days: Date[];\n  eventsByDay: Map<string, CalendarEvent[]>;\n  canCreate: boolean;\n  onSelectEvent: (event: CalendarEvent) => void;\n  onShowDay: (day: Date) => void;\n  onCreateAt: (day: Date) => void;\n}\n\nconst chipPalette = [\n  \"bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 hover:bg-indigo-200\",\n  \"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-200\",\n  \"bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 hover:bg-amber-200\",\n  \"bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 hover:bg-rose-200\",\n  \"bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 hover:bg-sky-200\",\n  \"bg-violet-100 text-violet-800 hover:bg-violet-200\",\n];\n\nexport function MonthView({\n  days,\n  eventsByDay,\n  canCreate,\n  onSelectEvent,\n  onShowDay,\n  onCreateAt,\n}: MonthViewProps) {\n  const today = todayUtc();\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\">\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-7 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50\">\n        {WEEKDAYS.map((weekday) => (\n          <div\n            key={weekday}\n            className=\"px-2 py-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500\"\n          >\n            {weekday}\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-7\">\n        {days.map((day) => {\n          const key = dateKey(day);\n          const events = eventsByDay.get(key) ?? [];\n          const isToday = isSameDay(day, today);\n          const isCurrentMonth = day.getUTCMonth() === days[20].getUTCMonth();\n          const visible = events.slice(0, MAX_VISIBLE);\n          const hidden = events.length - visible.length;\n\n          return (\n            <div\n              key={key}\n              className={`group min-h-[7.5rem] border-b border-r border-slate-100 p-1.5 last:border-r-0 ${\n                isCurrentMonth ? \"bg-white\" : \"bg-slate-50/60\"\n              }`}\n            >\n              <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  onClick={() => onShowDay(day)}\n                  className={`flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-semibold transition ${\n                    isToday\n                      ? \"bg-indigo-600 text-white\"\n                      : isCurrentMonth\n                        ? \"text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200\"\n                        : \"text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-200\"\n                  }`}\n                  aria-label={`Show ${key}`}\n                >\n                  {day.getUTCDate()}\n                </button>\n                {canCreate ? (\n                  <button\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => onCreateAt(day)}\n                    className=\"rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-600 opacity-0 transition hover:bg-indigo-50 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100\"\n                    aria-label={`Add event on ${key}`}\n                  >\n                    + Add\n                  </button>\n                ) : null}\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"mt-1 space-y-1\">\n                {visible.map((event) => (\n                  <button\n                    key={event.id}\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => onSelectEvent(event)}\n                    className={`flex w-full items-center gap-1 truncate rounded-md px-1.5 py-1 text-left text-xs font-medium transition ${\n                      chipPalette[event.id % chipPalette.length]\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    <span className=\"tabular-nums opacity-70\">{formatTime(event.start_time)}</span>\n                    <span className=\"truncate\">{event.title}</span>\n                  </button>\n                ))}\n                {hidden > 0 ? (\n                  <button\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    onClick={() => onShowDay(day)}\n                    className=\"w-full rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 text-left text-xs font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-50\"\n                  >\n                    +{hidden} more\n                  </button>\n                ) : null}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          );\n        })}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/MonthView.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/MonthView.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/MonthView.tsx","time":{"start":1794352451109,"end":1794352451122}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c7bd8e1d001Vj8OdQMPP50lBr","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","messageID":"msg_1c7bd6d46001XfgSTcJ8Y2hYvs"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1794352451148,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7bd8e350012KbJXLegIBje5B","reason":"tool-calls","messageID":"msg_1c7bd6d46001XfgSTcJ8Y2hYvs","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":58700,"input":547,"output":1112,"reasoning":738,"cache":{"write":0,"read":56303}},"cost":0}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794352458536,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7bdab1c001rSDdUXe16qtlLG","messageID":"msg_1c7bd8e44001heYqTJNCce6iH2","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794352458556,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c7bd94bd7086a852176f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { dateKey, durationMinutes, isSameDay, minutesOfDay, pad, todayUtc } from \"../lib/dates\";\nimport type { CalendarEvent } from \"../types\";\n\nconst HOUR_HEIGHT = 56;\nconst HOURS = Array.from({ length: 24 }, (_, index) => index);\n\ninterface TimeGridProps {\n  days: Date[];\n  eventsByDay: Map<string, CalendarEvent[]>;\n  canCreate: boolean;\n  onSelectEvent: (event: CalendarEvent) => void;\n  onCreateAt: (day: Date, minutes: number) => void;\n}\n\ninterface Placement {\n  event: CalendarEvent;\n  lane: number;\n  lanes: number;\n}\n\n/** Assign overlapping events to side-by-side lanes so none are hidden. */\nfunction layoutDay(events: CalendarEvent[]): Placement[] {\n  const sorted = [...events].sort(\n    (a, b) =>\n      a.start_time.localeCompare(b.start_time) || a.end_time.localeCompare(b.end_time),\n  );\n  const placements: Placement[] = [];\n  let cluster: CalendarEvent[] = [];\n  let clusterEnd = -Infinity;\n\n  const flush = () => {\n    if (cluster.length === 0) return;\n    const laneEnds: number[] = [];\n    const assignments = cluster.map((event) => {\n      const start = new Date(event.start_time).getTime();\n      const end = new Date(event.end_time).getTime();\n      let lane = laneEnds.findIndex((laneEnd) => laneEnd <= start);\n      if (lane === -1) {\n        lane = laneEnds.length;\n        laneEnds.push(end);\n      } else {\n        laneEnds[lane] = end;\n      }\n      return { event, lane };\n    });\n    const lanes = laneEnds.length;\n    for (const assignment of assignments) {\n      placements.push({ ...assignment, lanes });\n    }\n    cluster = [];\n    clusterEnd = -Infinity;\n  };\n\n  for (const event of sorted) {\n    const start = new Date(event.start_time).getTime();\n    if (cluster.length > 0 && start >= clusterEnd) flush();\n    cluster.push(event);\n    clusterEnd = Math.max(clusterEnd, new Date(event.end_time).getTime());\n  }\n  flush();\n\n  return placements;\n}\n\nconst chipPalette = [\n  \"bg-indigo-500/90 text-white border-indigo-600\",\n  \"bg-emerald-500/90 text-white border-emerald-600\",\n  \"bg-amber-500/90 text-white border-amber-600\",\n  \"bg-rose-500/90 text-white border-rose-600\",\n  \"bg-sky-500/90 text-white border-sky-600\",\n  \"bg-violet-500/90 text-white border-violet-600\",\n];\n\nexport function TimeGrid({\n  days,\n  eventsByDay,\n  canCreate,\n  onSelectEvent,\n  onCreateAt,\n}: TimeGridProps) {\n  const today = todayUtc();\n  const now = new Date();\n  const nowMinutes = now.getUTCHours() * 60 + now.getUTCMinutes();\n  const template = `4rem repeat(${days.length}, minmax(0, 1fr))`;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\">\n      <div className=\"min-w-[44rem]\">\n        <div className=\"grid border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50\" style={{ gridTemplateColumns: template }}>\n          <div />\n          {days.map((day) => {\n            const isToday = isSameDay(day, today);\n            return (\n              <div\n                key={dateKey(day)}\n                className={`border-l border-slate-200 px-2 py-2 text-center ${\n                  isToday ? \"bg-indigo-50\" : \"\"\n                }`}\n              >\n                <div className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500\">\n                  {day.toLocaleDateString(\"en-GB\", { timeZone: \"UTC\", weekday: \"short\" })}\n                </div>\n                <div\n                  className={`mx-auto mt-1 flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-semibold ${\n                    isToday ? \"bg-indigo-600 text-white\" : \"text-slate-800\"\n                  }`}\n                >\n                  {day.getUTCDate()}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            );\n          })}\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"grid\" style={{ gridTemplateColumns: template }}>\n          <div className=\"relative\" style={{ height: HOUR_HEIGHT * 24 }}>\n            {HOURS.map((hour) => (\n              <span\n                key={hour}\n                className=\"absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[11px] tabular-nums text-slate-400\"\n                style={{ top: hour * HOUR_HEIGHT }}\n              >\n                {pad(hour)}:00\n              </span>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n\n          {days.map((day) => {\n            const key = dateKey(day);\n            const events = eventsByDay.get(key) ?? [];\n            const placements = layoutDay(events);\n            const isToday = isSameDay(day, today);\n\n            return (\n              <div\n                key={key}\n                className={`relative border-l border-slate-200 ${\n                  canCreate ? \"cursor-crosshair\" : \"\"\n                }`}\n                style={{ height: HOUR_HEIGHT * 24 }}\n                onClick={(clickEvent) => {\n                  if (!canCreate) return;\n                  const bounds = clickEvent.currentTarget.getBoundingClientRect();\n                  const offset = clickEvent.clientY - bounds.top;\n                  const minutes = Math.min(23 * 60 + 59, Math.max(0, Math.floor((offset / HOUR_HEIGHT) * 60)));\n                  onCreateAt(day, minutes - (minutes % 30));\n                }}\n              >\n                {HOURS.map((hour) => (\n                  <div\n                    key={hour}\n                    className=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 border-t border-slate-100\"\n                    style={{ top: hour * HOUR_HEIGHT }}\n                  />\n                ))}\n\n                {isToday ? (\n                  <div\n                    className=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 z-20 border-t-2 border-red-500\"\n                    style={{ top: (nowMinutes / 60) * HOUR_HEIGHT }}\n                  />\n                ) : null}\n\n                {placements.map(({ event, lane, lanes }) => {\n                  const start = minutesOfDay(event.start_time);\n                  const duration = durationMinutes(event.start_time, event.end_time);\n                  const top = (start / 60) * HOUR_HEIGHT;\n                  const height = Math.max(22, (duration / 60) * HOUR_HEIGHT - 2);\n                  const width = 100 / lanes;\n                  return (\n                    <button\n                      key={event.id}\n                      type=\"button\"\n                      onClick={(clickEvent) => {\n                        clickEvent.stopPropagation();\n                        onSelectEvent(event);\n                      }}\n                      title={`${event.title} - ${event.location ?? \"\"}`}\n                      className={`absolute overflow-hidden rounded-md border px-1.5 py-1 text-left text-[11px] font-medium leading-tight shadow-sm transition hover:brightness-95 ${\n                        chipPalette[event.id % chipPalette.length]\n                      }`}\n                      style={{\n                        top,\n                        height,\n                        left: `calc(${lane * width}% + 2px)`,\n                        width: `calc(${width}% - 4px)`,\n                      }}\n                    >\n                      <span className=\"block truncate\">{event.title}</span>\n                      <span className=\"block truncate opacity-80\">\n                        {pad(Math.floor(start / 60))}:{pad(start % 60)}\n                        {event.location ? ` - ${event.location}` : \"\"}\n                      </span>\n                    </button>\n                  );\n                })}\n              </div>\n            );\n          })}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/TimeGrid.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/TimeGrid.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/TimeGrid.tsx","time":{"start":1794352458532,"end":1794352458539}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c7bdab1e001IVVDZ37lel0mdZ","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","messageID":"msg_1c7bd8e44001heYqTJNCce6iH2"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1794352458556,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7bdab2d001nTZQQ6NhuoQbA0","reason":"tool-calls","messageID":"msg_1c7bd8e44001heYqTJNCce6iH2","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":60478,"input":1869,"output":1759,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"write":0,"read":56850}},"cost":0}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794352495446,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7be3b41001TmRNzANp58RYSu","messageID":"msg_1c7bdab37001JnqKtIjYtsr5n6","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794352495446,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7be3b44001rLquxrUbG0mKDh","messageID":"msg_1c7bdab37001JnqKtIjYtsr5n6","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the App.tsx that ties everything together, plus main.tsx and index.css.\n\nApp structure:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { ApiError, api, clearSession, loadSession, saveSession } from \"./api\";\nimport { AuthPanel } from \"./components/AuthPanel\";\nimport { ConfirmDialog } from \"./components/ConfirmDialog\";\nimport { EventDetailsModal } from \"./components/EventDetailsModal\";\nimport { EventFormModal, type EventFormValues } from \"./components/EventFormModal\";\nimport { MonthView } from \"./components/MonthView\";\nimport { TimeGrid } from \"./components/TimeGrid\";\nimport { addDays, addMonths, dateKey, formatDayTitle, formatMonthTitle, formatWeekTitle, startOfDay, startOfMonth, startOfWeek, todayUtc } from \"./lib/dates\";\nimport type { CalendarEvent, Session, ViewMode } from \"./types\";\n```\n\nState + handlers as planned.\n\nLet me write the toolbar with view tabs:\n```tsx\nconst views: {id: ViewMode; label: string}[] = [\n  {id: \"month\", label: \"Month\"},\n  {id: \"week\", label: \"Week\"},\n  {id: \"day\", label: \"Day\"},\n];\n```\n\nNavigation buttons: prev, Today, next with aria-labels.\n\nAlso, the header shows the signed-in username and a Sign out button.\n\nNow about signing out: clearSession(), setSession(null), and close modals.\n\nAlso handle a 401 during an action (e.g., token expired) → show a notice and sign out. I'll add a helper that catches ApiError with status 401 → clear session + message.\n\nLet me write the App.\n\nAlso the \"notice\" toast for messages like \"Event created\".\n\nLet me write it now.\n\nOne important detail: the create form initial values. When clicking \"New event\", default start = now (rounded to the next half hour), end = +1h. Since we use UTC, compute from the current UTC time.\n\n```ts\nfunction defaultDraft(): EventFormValues {\n  const now = new Date();\n  const minutes = now.getUTCMinutes();\n  const start = new Date(Date.UTC(now.getUTCFullYear(), now.getUTCMonth(), now.getUTCDate(), now.getUTCHours(), minutes < 30 ? 30 : 60 === 0 ? 0 : 60 ...));\n```\nSimpler: round up to the next half hour:\n```ts\nconst rounded = Math.ceil((now.getUTCHours()*60 + now.getUTCMinutes())/30)*30;\nconst startDate = new Date(Date.UTC(y, m, d, 0, 0) + rounded*60000);\nconst endDate = new Date(startDate.getTime() + 3600000);\n```\nCareful: rounded could be 1440 → next day 00:00. Fine.\n\nThen the draft strings: `${dateKey(startDate)}T${timeKey(startDate)}`.\n\nFor \"create at\" a specific slot: start = day + minutes, end = +1h.\n\nLet me write the App file now.\n\nAlso: the fetch effect should re-run when the session changes (not needed since GET is public).\n\nWhen an event is created/updated/deleted, refresh the list (refetch). I'll implement `refresh()` via a `reloadToken` state counter included in the effect deps.\n\nLet me write it.</think>\n\nNow the main App component:","time":{"start":1794352495428,"end":1794352495442}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794352495473,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c7bdbf2a7229a46efe43","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useState } from \"react\";\n\nimport { ApiError, api, clearSession, loadSession, saveSession } from \"./api\";\nimport { AuthPanel } from \"./components/AuthPanel\";\nimport { ConfirmDialog } from \"./components/ConfirmDialog\";\nimport { EventDetailsModal } from \"./components/EventDetailsModal\";\nimport { EventFormModal } from \"./components/EventFormModal\";\nimport type { EventFormValues } from \"./components/EventFormModal\";\nimport { MonthView } from \"./components/MonthView\";\nimport { TimeGrid } from \"./components/TimeGrid\";\nimport {\n  addDays,\n  addMonths,\n  dateKey,\n  formatDayTitle,\n  formatMonthTitle,\n  formatWeekTitle,\n  minutesOfDay,\n  parseIso,\n  startOfDay,\n  startOfMonth,\n  startOfWeek,\n  timeKey,\n  todayUtc,\n} from \"./lib/dates\";\nimport type { CalendarEvent, Session, ViewMode } from \"./types\";\n\nconst VIEW_TABS: { id: ViewMode; label: string }[] = [\n  { id: \"month\", label: \"Month\" },\n  { id: \"week\", label: \"Week\" },\n  { id: \"day\", label: \"Day\" },\n];\n\ninterface VisibleRange {\n  start: Date;\n  end: Date;\n  days: Date[];\n}\n\nfunction visibleRange(view: ViewMode, anchor: Date): VisibleRange {\n  if (view === \"month\") {\n    const first = startOfWeek(startOfMonth(anchor));\n    const days = Array.from({ length: 42 }, (_, index) => addDays(first, index));\n    return { start: days[0], end: days[days.length - 1], days };\n  }\n  if (view === \"week\") {\n    const first = startOfWeek(anchor);\n    const days = Array.from({ length: 7 }, (_, index) => addDays(first, index));\n    return { start: days[0], end: days[days.length - 1], days };\n  }\n  const day = startOfDay(anchor);\n  return { start: day, end: day, days: [day] };\n}\n\nfunction defaultValues(day: Date, minutes: number): EventFormValues {\n  const start = new Date(day.getTime() + minutes * 60_000);\n  const end = new Date(start.getTime() + 60 * 60_000);\n  return {\n    title: \"\",\n    description: \"\",\n    location: \"\",\n    start: `${dateKey(start)}T${timeKey(start)}`,\n    end: `${dateKey(end)}T${timeKey(end)}`,\n  };\n}\n\nfunction nextHalfHour(): { day: Date; minutes: number } {\n  const now = new Date();\n  const minutes = Math.ceil((now.getUTCHours() * 60 + now.getUTCMinutes()) / 30) * 30;\n  const day = startOfDay(now);\n  return { day, minutes };\n}\n\nexport default function App() {\n  const [session, setSession] = useState<Session | null>(() => loadSession());\n  const [view, setView] = useState<ViewMode>(\"month\");\n  const [anchor, setAnchor] = useState<Date>(() => todayUtc());\n  const [events, setEvents] = useState<CalendarEvent[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n  const [loadError, setLoadError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [reloadToken, setReloadToken] = useState(0);\n  const [selected, setSelected] = useState<CalendarEvent | null>(null);\n  const [formState, setFormState] = useState<{\n    mode: \"create\" | \"edit\";\n    event?: CalendarEvent;\n    initial: EventFormValues;\n  } | null>(null);\n  const [deleting, setDeleting] = useState<CalendarEvent | null>(null);\n  const [notice, setNotice] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [authTab, setAuthTab] = useState<\"login\" | \"register\">(\"login\");\n\n  const range = useMemo(() => visibleRange(view, anchor), [view, anchor]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let cancelled = false;\n    setLoading(true);\n    api\n      .listEvents({\n        start_date: dateKey(range.start),\n        end_date: dateKey(range.end),\n      })\n      .then((data) => {\n        if (cancelled) return;\n        setEvents(data.items);\n        setLoadError(null);\n      })\n      .catch((error: unknown) => {\n        if (cancelled) return;\n        setLoadError(\n          error instanceof ApiError ? error.message : \"The events could not be loaded.\",\n        );\n      })\n      .finally(() => {\n        if (!cancelled) setLoading(false);\n      });\n    return () => {\n      cancelled = true;\n    };\n  }, [range, reloadToken]);\n\n  const eventsByDay = useMemo(() => {\n    const map = new Map<string, CalendarEvent[]>();\n    for (const event of events) {\n      const key = dateKey(parseIso(event.start_time));\n      const list = map.get(key);\n      if (list) list.push(event);\n      else map.set(key, [event]);\n    }\n    for (const list of map.values()) {\n      list.sort((a, b) => a.start_time.localeCompare(b.start_time));\n    }\n    return map;\n  }, [events]);\n\n  const refresh = useCallback(() => setReloadToken((token) => token + 1), []);\n\n  const handleSignedIn = (next: Session) => {\n    saveSession(next.token, next.username);\n    setSession(next);\n    setNotice(`Signed in as ${next.username}.`);\n  };\n\n  const handleSignOut = () => {\n    clearSession();\n    setSession(null);\n    setSelected(null);\n    setFormState(null);\n    setDeleting(null);\n    setNotice(\"You have been signed out.\");\n  };\n\n  const goToPrevious = () => {\n    if (view === \"month\") setAnchor((current) => addMonths(current, -1));\n    else if (view === \"week\") setAnchor((current) => addDays(current, -7));\n    else setAnchor((current) => addDays(current, -1));\n  };\n\n  const goToNext = () => {\n    if (view === \"month\") setAnchor((current) => addMonths(current, 1));\n    else if (view === \"week\") setAnchor((current) => addDays(current, 7));\n    else setAnchor((current) => addDays(current, 1));\n  };\n\n  const goToToday = () => setAnchor(todayUtc());\n\n  const showDay = (day: Date) => {\n    setAnchor(startOfDay(day));\n    setView(\"day\");\n  };\n\n  const openCreateForm = (day: Date, minutes?: number) => {\n    if (!session) {\n      setAuthTab(\"login\");\n      document.getElementById(\"auth-panel\")?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\" });\n      return;\n    }\n    const slot = minutes ?? 0;\n    const base = minutes === undefined ? nextHalfHour() : { day: startOfDay(day), minutes: slot };\n    setFormState({ mode: \"create\", initial: defaultValues(base.day, base.minutes) });\n  };\n\n  const openEditForm = (event: CalendarEvent) => {\n    setSelected(null);\n    setFormState({ mode: \"edit\", event, initial: defaultValues(startOfDay(parseIso(event.start_time)), minutesOfDay(event.start_time)) });\n  };\n\n  const handleSaved = (event: CalendarEvent) => {\n    setFormState(null);\n    setNotice(\n      formState?.mode === \"edit\" ? \"The event was updated.\" : `“${event.title}” was added.`,\n    );\n    refresh();\n  };\n\n  const handleDeleted = () => {\n    const title = deleting?.title ?? \"Event\";\n    setDeleting(null);\n    setSelected(null);\n    setNotice(`“${title}” was deleted.`);\n    refresh();\n  };\n\n  const title =\n    view === \"month\"\n      ? formatMonthTitle(anchor)\n      : view === \"week\"\n        ? formatWeekTitle(startOfWeek(anchor))\n        : formatDayTitle(anchor);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex min-h-screen flex-col bg-slate-100 text-slate-900\">\n      <header className=\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-white\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 sm:px-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span className=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" className=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"1.8\">\n                <rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"5\" width=\"17\" height=\"15.5\" rx=\"2.5\" />\n                <path d=\"M3.5 9.5h17M8 3.5v3M16 3.5v3\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" />\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <div>\n              <h1 className=\"text-lg font-semibold leading-tight\">Event Calendar</h1>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">A shared calendar for the whole team</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            {session ? (\n              <>\n                <span className=\"hidden items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-indigo-700 sm:flex\">\n                  <span className=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-white\">\n                    {session.username.slice(0, 1)}\n                  </span>\n                  <span>\n                    Signed in as <span className=\"font-semibold\">{session.username}</span>\n                  </span>\n                </span>\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  onClick={handleSignOut}\n                  className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50\"\n                >\n                  Sign out\n                </button>\n              </>\n            ) : (\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  onClick={() => {\n                    setAuthTab(\"login\");\n                    document.getElementById(\"auth-panel\")?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\" });\n                  }}\n                  className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50\"\n                >\n                  Sign in\n                </button>\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  onClick={() => {\n                    setAuthTab(\"register\");\n                    document.getElementById(\"auth-panel\")?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\" });\n                  }}\n                  className=\"rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-500\"\n                >\n                  Register\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            )}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <main className=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl flex-1 px-4 pb-12 sm:px-6\">\n        {notice ? (\n          <div className=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-indigo-800\">\n            <span>{notice}</span>\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              onClick={() => setNotice(null)}\n              className=\"rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-700 hover:bg-indigo-100\"\n            >\n              Dismiss\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        ) : null}\n\n        {!session ? (\n          <AuthPanel\n            activeTab={authTab}\n            onTabChange={setAuthTab}\n            onSignedIn={handleSignedIn}\n          />\n        ) : null}\n\n        <section className=\"mt-6\" aria-label=\"Calendar\">\n          <div className=\"mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <div\n                className=\"inline-flex rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-0.5 shadow-sm\"\n                role=\"tablist\"\n                aria-label=\"Calendar view\"\n              >\n                {VIEW_TABS.map((tab) => (\n                  <button\n                    key={tab.id}\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    role=\"tab\"\n                    aria-selected={view === tab.id}\n                    onClick={() => setView(tab.id)}\n                    className={`rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition ${\n                      view === tab.id\n                        ? \"bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-sm\"\n                        : \"text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\"\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    {tab.label}\n                  </button>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-0.5 shadow-sm\">\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  onClick={goToPrevious}\n                  aria-label=\"Previous period\"\n                  className=\"rounded-md p-1.5 text-slate-600 transition hover:bg-slate-100\"\n                >\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" className=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2\">\n                    <path d=\"M12 4l-6 6 6 6\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" />\n                  </svg>\n                </button>\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  onClick={goToToday}\n                  className=\"rounded-md px-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-100\"\n                >\n                  Today\n                </button>\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  onClick={goToNext}\n                  aria-label=\"Next period\"\n                  className=\"rounded-md p-1.5 text-slate-600 transition hover:bg-slate-100\"\n                >\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" className=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2\">\n                    <path d=\"M8 4l6 6-6 6\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" />\n                  </svg>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n\n              <h2 className=\"ml-1 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800\">{title}</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n              {loading ? <span className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Loading…</span> : null}\n              {session ? (\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  onClick={() => openCreateForm(anchor)}\n                  className=\"rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-3.5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-indigo-500\"\n                >\n                  + New event\n                </button>\n              ) : (\n                <span className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">\n                  Sign in to create and edit events.\n                </span>\n              )}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {loadError ? (\n            <p className=\"mb-4 rounded-xl bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-700\">{loadError}</p>\n          ) : null}\n\n          {view === \"month\" ? (\n            <MonthView\n              days={range.days}\n              eventsByDay={eventsByDay}\n              canCreate={Boolean(session)}\n              onSelectEvent={setSelected}\n              onShowDay={showDay}\n              onCreateAt={(day) => openCreateForm(day, 9 * 60)}\n            />\n          ) : (\n            <TimeGrid\n              days={range.days}\n              eventsByDay={eventsByDay}\n              canCreate={Boolean(session)}\n              onSelectEvent={setSelected}\n              onCreateAt={(day, minutes) => openCreateForm(day, minutes)}\n            />\n          )}\n\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-500\">\n            {events.length} event{events.length === 1 ? \"\" : \"s\"} in this period · times shown in\n            UTC\n          </p>\n        </section>\n      </main>\n\n      {selected ? (\n        <EventDetailsModal\n          event={selected}\n          canEdit={Boolean(session)}\n          onClose={() => setSelected(null)}\n          onEdit={() => openEditForm(selected)}\n          onDelete={() => setDeleting(selected)}\n        />\n      ) : null}\n\n      {deleting ? (\n        <ConfirmDialog\n          event={deleting}\n          onCancel={() => setDeleting(null)}\n          onConfirmed={handleDeleted}\n        />\n      ) : null}\n\n      {formState ? (\n        <EventFormModal\n          mode={formState.mode}\n          event={formState.event}\n          initial={formState.initial}\n          onClose={() => setFormState(null)}\n          onSaved={handleSaved}\n        />\n      ) : null}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/App.tsx","time":{"start":1794352495438,"end":1794352495452}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c7be3b470017BqwQYOsIqaDqT","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","messageID":"msg_1c7bdab37001JnqKtIjYtsr5n6"}}
