{"type":"text","timestamp":1794352511641,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7be7a7b001ITSglWT5Y3HwVh","messageID":"msg_1c7be6be9001BA6jODWE1RhtnI","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"text","text":"<think>The build succeeded and Tailwind CSS is generating 25 kB of CSS (utilities are being generated).\n\nWait — the CSS is 25 kB, which suggests Tailwind is picking up the classes. Good.\n\nNow let me run the full stack locally and test in a browser. Let me check if there's a headless browser available for testing (playwright? chromium?). Let me check.\n\nFirst, start the backend serving the built frontend:\n```\nDATA_DIR=/workspace/data .venv/bin/gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app\n```\nfrom /workspace.\n\nThen curl the endpoints and the frontend.\n\nLet me also check for a browser for UItesting.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794352511611,"end":1794352511637}}}
