{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794352627174,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c7c031c973f1b384ef3c","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/tmpjsdom && node render.mjs 2>&1 | tail -25"},"output":"--- rendered text ---\nEvent CalendarA shared calendar for the whole teamSign inRegisterSign in to manage eventsBrowsing is open to everyone; signing in lets you create and edit events.Sign inRegisterUsernamePasswordSign inMonthWeekDayTodayNovember 2026Sign in to create and edit events.MonTueWedThuFriSatSun2627282930311234567891009:00Standup11121314151617181920212223242526272829301234561 event in this period · times shown in UTC\n--- errors ---\nnone\n--- checks ---\n{\n  title: true,\n  auth: true,\n  register: true,\n  monthTab: true,\n  today: true,\n  monthGrid: true\n}\n","metadata":{"output":"--- rendered text ---\nEvent CalendarA shared calendar for the whole teamSign inRegisterSign in to manage eventsBrowsing is open to everyone; signing in lets you create and edit events.Sign inRegisterUsernamePasswordSign inMonthWeekDayTodayNovember 2026Sign in to create and edit events.MonTueWedThuFriSatSun2627282930311234567891009:00Standup11121314151617181920212223242526272829301234561 event in this period · times shown in UTC\n--- errors ---\nnone\n--- checks ---\n{\n  title: true,\n  auth: true,\n  register: true,\n  monthTab: true,\n  today: true,\n  monthGrid: true\n}\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/tmpjsdom && node render.mjs 2>&1 | tail -25","time":{"start":1794352624680,"end":1794352627154}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c7c03422001EveGRDfAR0d6U2","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","messageID":"msg_1c7c02be0001sX4xFCtsMI7QiC"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1794352627175,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7c03dd5001gD3vWM337ZQBvE","reason":"tool-calls","messageID":"msg_1c7c02be0001sX4xFCtsMI7QiC","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":77992,"input":415,"output":45,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"write":0,"read":77532}},"cost":0}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794352636883,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7c063c0001720HcVRC1ia2OW","messageID":"msg_1c7c03de1001nUv75DiaVdNJ0B","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794352636883,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7c063c3001FTYHsddXb3xcit","messageID":"msg_1c7c03de1001nUv75DiaVdNJ0B","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"text","text":"<think>The app renders and loads events from the API (\"Standup\" event on Nov 10 at 09:00).\n\nNow let me write a more thorough interaction test in jsdom: register, sign in, create an event, edit, delete, navigate views. This simulates the user flows. jsdom can dispatch click events on buttons.\n\nLet me write an interactive test:\n1. Load the app.\n2. Click the \"Register\" tab in the auth panel, fill the username/password inputs, submit → check that the header shows \"Signed in as\".\n3. Click \"+ New event\" → the form modal appears → fill title/start/end → submit → check the event appears in the grid.\n4. Click the event → details modal appears → click Edit → change the title → save.\n5. Click Delete → confirm → check it's gone.\n6. Switch views: Week, Day, and navigate prev/next, Today.\n\nThis is a valuable end-to-end test. Let me write it with helper functions to find elements by text.\n\njsdom supports form input value setting via the native setter + dispatching an \"input\" event (React 19 listens for \"input\" events on the root container). Since React attaches listeners at the root, dispatching an `input` event with bubbles: true works.\n\nLet me write it.\n\nNote: the app's localStorage persists the session between jsdom runs within the same process — fine.\n\nFor datetime-local inputs, set value like \"2026-11-12T10:00\".\n\nLet me write the test.</think>\n\nLet me write an end-to-end interaction test in jsdom:","time":{"start":1794352636867,"end":1794352636880}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794352636904,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c7c04c5d71ca8634bc87","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"/** End-to-end interaction test of the built frontend against the live API. */\nimport fs from \"node:fs\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { JSDOM } from \"jsdom\";\n\nconst distDir = path.resolve(\"../frontend/dist\");\nconst html = fs.readFileSync(path.join(distDir, \"index.html\"), \"utf-8\");\nconst asset = fs\n  .readdirSync(path.join(distDir, \"assets\"))\n  .find((name) => name.endsWith(\".js\"));\n\nconst dom = new JSDOM(html, { url: \"http://localhost:8000/\", pretendToBeVisual: true });\nglobal.window = dom.window;\nglobal.document = dom.window.document;\nObject.defineProperty(global, \"navigator\", { value: dom.window.navigator, configurable: true });\nglobal.HTMLElement = dom.window.HTMLElement;\nglobal.Element = dom.window.Element;\nglobal.Node = dom.window.Node;\nglobal.Event = dom.window.Event;\nglobal.MouseEvent = dom.window.MouseEvent;\nglobal.KeyboardEvent = dom.window.KeyboardEvent;\nglobal.getComputedStyle = dom.window.getComputedStyle;\nglobal.requestAnimationFrame = dom.window.requestAnimationFrame.bind(dom.window);\nglobal.cancelAnimationFrame = dom.window.cancelAnimationFrame.bind(dom.window);\nglobal.MessageChannel = dom.window.MessageChannel;\nglobal.MutationObserver = dom.window.MutationObserver;\nglobal.CustomEvent = dom.window.CustomEvent;\nglobal.DOMException = dom.window.DOMException;\nglobal.localStorage = dom.window.localStorage;\nconst nodeFetch = globalThis.fetch;\nglobal.fetch = (input, init) => {\n  const url = new URL(typeof input === \"string\" ? input : input.url, \"http://localhost:8000\");\n  return nodeFetch(`http://127.0.0.1:8000${url.pathname}${url.search}`, init);\n};\n\nconst errors = [];\nconst originalError = console.error;\nconsole.error = (...args) => {\n  errors.push(args.map(String).join(\" \"));\n  originalError(...args);\n};\ndom.window.addEventListener(\"error\", (event) => errors.push(String(event.error || event.message)));\n\nconst doc = dom.window.document;\nconst sleep = (ms) => new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, ms));\nconst results = [];\nconst check = (label, condition) => {\n  results.push([label, Boolean(condition)]);\n  console.log(`${condition ? \"PASS\" : \"FAIL\"} - ${label}`);\n};\n\nfunction byText(selector, text) {\n  return [...doc.querySelectorAll(selector)].find((node) =>\n    node.textContent.trim() === text,\n  );\n}\n\nfunction click(node) {\n  node.dispatchEvent(new dom.window.MouseEvent(\"click\", { bubbles: true, cancelable: true }));\n}\n\nfunction setValue(input, value) {\n  const prototype = Object.getPrototypeOf(input);\n  const setter = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(prototype, \"value\").set;\n  setter.call(input, value);\n  input.dispatchEvent(new dom.window.Event(\"input\", { bubbles: true }));\n}\n\nawait import(path.join(distDir, \"assets\", asset));\nawait sleep(800);\n\n// --- register ---------------------------------------------------------------\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Register\"));\nawait sleep(100);\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"register-username\"]'), \"tester\");\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"register-password\"]'), \"secret123\");\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Create account\"));\nawait sleep(800);\ncheck(\"signed in after registration\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Signed in as tester\"));\n\n// --- create -----------------------------------------------------------------\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"+ New event\"));\nawait sleep(200);\nconst titleInput = doc.querySelector('input[name=\"title\"]');\ncheck(\"event form opened\", Boolean(titleInput));\nsetValue(titleInput, \"Design review\");\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"start_time\"]'), \"2026-11-12T14:00\");\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"end_time\"]'), \"2026-11-12T15:30\");\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"location\"]'), \"Room 5\");\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Create event\"));\nawait sleep(800);\ncheck(\"event created\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Design review\"));\n\n// --- validation errors from the API -----------------------------------------\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"+ New event\"));\nawait sleep(200);\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"title\"]'), \"\");\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"start_time\"]'), \"2026-11-12T16:00\");\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"end_time\"]'), \"2026-11-12T15:00\");\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Create event\"));\nawait sleep(600);\nconst bodyText = doc.body.textContent;\ncheck(\"api validation message shown\", bodyText.includes(\"Title is required.\"));\ncheck(\"api end time message shown\", bodyText.includes(\"End time must not be earlier\"));\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Cancel\"));\nawait sleep(200);\n\n// --- details + edit ---------------------------------------------------------\nconst eventChip = [...doc.querySelectorAll(\"button\")].find((node) =>\n  node.textContent.includes(\"Design review\"),\n);\nclick(eventChip);\nawait sleep(300);\ncheck(\"details modal opened\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Event details\"));\ncheck(\"details show creator\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"tester\"));\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Edit\"));\nawait sleep(300);\nsetValue(doc.querySelector('input[name=\"title\"]'), \"Design review v2\");\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Save changes\"));\nawait sleep(800);\ncheck(\"event updated\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Design review v2\"));\n\n// --- delete with confirmation -----------------------------------------------\nconst updatedChip = [...doc.querySelectorAll(\"button\")].find((node) =>\n  node.textContent.includes(\"Design review v2\"),\n);\nclick(updatedChip);\nawait sleep(300);\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Delete\"));\nawait sleep(300);\ncheck(\"confirmation dialog shown\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Are you sure you want to delete\"));\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Delete event\"));\nawait sleep(800);\ncheck(\"event deleted\", !doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Design review v2\"));\n\n// --- views and navigation ---------------------------------------------------\nconst monthTitle = doc.querySelector(\"h2\").textContent;\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Week\"));\nawait sleep(500);\ncheck(\"week view rendered\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Mon\") && doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Sun\"));\ncheck(\"week view has hour labels\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"00:00\"));\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Day\"));\nawait sleep(500);\ncheck(\"day view rendered\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"events in this period\"));\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Month\"));\nawait sleep(500);\ncheck(\"month view restored\", doc.querySelector(\"h2\").textContent === monthTitle);\n\nconst titleBefore = doc.querySelector(\"h2\").textContent;\nclick(doc.querySelector('button[aria-label=\"Next period\"]'));\nawait sleep(500);\ncheck(\"next period changes title\", doc.querySelector(\"h2\").textContent !== titleBefore);\nclick(doc.querySelector('button[aria-label=\"Previous period\"]'));\nawait sleep(500);\ncheck(\"previous period restores title\", doc.querySelector(\"h2\").textContent === titleBefore);\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Today\"));\nawait sleep(500);\ncheck(\"today button works\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"events in this period\"));\n\n// --- sign out ---------------------------------------------------------------\nclick(byText(\"button\", \"Sign out\"));\nawait sleep(300);\ncheck(\"signed out\", doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Sign in\") && !doc.body.textContent.includes(\"Signed in as\"));\n\nconsole.log(\"--- errors ---\");\nconsole.log(errors.length ? errors.join(\"\\n\") : \"none\");\nconst failed = results.filter(([, ok]) => !ok).length;\nconsole.log(`${results.length - failed}/${results.length} checks passed`);\nprocess.exit(failed || errors.length ? 1 : 0);\n","filePath":"/workspace/tmpjsdom/interaction.mjs"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/tmpjsdom/interaction.mjs","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tmpjsdom/interaction.mjs","time":{"start":1794352636876,"end":1794352636886}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c7c063c6001NPhz5Z6S6GzBLP","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","messageID":"msg_1c7c03de1001nUv75DiaVdNJ0B"}}
