{"type":"text","timestamp":1794352679695,"sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","part":{"id":"prt_1c7c10afa001YEwkgYWo6MljJR","messageID":"msg_1c7c0fcc2001wYoBd1pBtT2mXf","sessionID":"ses_e3847c4f2ffeRaGpXufKYD9yDm","type":"text","text":"<think>Now registration fails — probably because the user \"tester\" already exists from the previous run (the database persists). The register returned 409 → not signed in.\n\nI should use a unique username per run. Let me use a random suffix.\n\nAlso for the delete check, refine it.\n\nLet me update the test.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794352679674,"end":1794352679691}}}
